.TH PDFLUENT-MODELS-INSTALL 1  "pdfluent 1.1.0" PDFluent
.SH NAME
pdfluent\-models\-install \- Download and verify model packages into the per\-user model dir. The only command that ever downloads a model or runtime library
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpdfluent models install\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIPACKAGES\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Download and verify model packages into the per\-user model dir. The only command that ever downloads a model or runtime library
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON envelope on stdout
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Quiet: human mode prints data only (no warnings or progress notes)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Verbose stderr diagnostics (repeat for more)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIPACKAGES\fR>
Which packages to install; several in one call
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
layout: The layout model (Heron\-ft ep03) plus the platform\*(Aqs ONNX Runtime
.IP \(bu 2
tables: The tables model (TATR v1.1\-all) plus the platform\*(Aqs ONNX Runtime
.RE
.SH VERSION
v1.1.0
